### Refactoring Metrics Target Matrix

| Metric | Monolithic Baseline | Refactored Architecture | Structural Benefit |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **LCOM4** | > 6 (Severely Fragmented) | **1.0** (Per class) | Perfect cohesion; each step/service operates on one dedicated set of data. |
| **Cyclomatic Complexity** | > 40 per method | **< 4** per method | Minimal branch points; easy verification and zero branch explosion. |
| **Test Setup Time** | High (Requires database, mailers, gateways) | **Low** (Pass focused step mocks) | Test step logic in milliseconds without touching external infrastructure. |
| **Blast Radius of Change** | Global (Modifying shipping breaks tax calculation) | **Local** (Isolated step modifications) | High safety; step logic changes do not spill over into unrelated steps. |
